<section class="uso home-operations case-slider" data-case-slider="" id="uso"><div class="uso-pin"><div aria-label="U.S. Oil Solutions case study slides" class="uso-track" id="caseUosTrack" tabindex="0"><div class="uso-intro"><span class="kick">Case 02 · U.S. Oil Solutions · Las Vegas</span><h2 class="disp uso-h" style="margin-top:18px">Oil management, online and on the job.</h2><a class="arrow" href="/work/us-oil-solutions/">Read the case →</a></div><div class="stamp"><div><span class="lab">01</span><div class="disp stamp-k">Website</div><span class="lab">Build</span><p class="stamp-p">Fryer-oil management, filtration, fresh-oil delivery and used-oil pickup—with clear service pages and inquiry paths.</p></div><div class="stamp-vis"><div class="stk" style="width:120px"><i style="width:100%"></i><i style="width:70%;background:var(--ink);animation-delay:.4s"></i><i style="width:85%;animation-delay:.8s"></i></div></div></div><div class="stamp"><div><span class="lab">02</span><div class="disp stamp-k">SEO</div><span class="lab">Demand</span><p class="stamp-p">Las Vegas search content answers restaurant questions about fryer-oil management, filtration and oil service.</p></div><div class="stamp-vis"><div class="bars"><i style="height:35%"></i><i style="height:55%;animation-delay:.2s"></i><i style="height:48%;animation-delay:.4s"></i><i style="height:78%;animation-delay:.6s"></i><i style="height:100%;background:var(--teal);animation-delay:.8s"></i></div></div></div><div class="stamp"><div><span class="lab">03</span><div class="disp stamp-k">Technicians</div><span class="lab">Operations app</span><p class="stamp-p">A separate operations app handles scheduling and check-ins, restaurant assignments, fryer records, replacement thresholds, camera capture and pause/resume controls.</p></div><div class="stamp-vis"><div class="dgrid"><i></i><i style="animation-delay:.3s"></i><i style="animation-delay:.6s"></i><i style="animation-delay:.9s"></i><i style="animation-delay:1.2s"></i>